<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>blue — external sources</title>
<style>
a { color: inherit }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; min-width: 740px }
th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid #292929; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap }
th { font-weight: normal; opacity: .5 }
.name { width: 30%; min-width: 180px }
.dim { opacity: .45 }
.state-healthy { color: #9bbf91 }
.state-blocked, .state-failed, .state-stale { color: #dab778 }



.note { font-size: 11px; opacity: .45; margin: 12px 0 0 }
@media (max-width: 600px) { th, td { padding: 9px } }
</style>
<%~ include("shell-style") %>
</head><body class="page-sources">
<%~ include("shell-nav", { active: "sources" }) %>
<% const phases = { not_configured: '未配置', installed: '客户端已安装', needs_authorization: '待授权', query_only: '已有工具 / 未确认持续同步', scheduled: '已有同步记录' }; const states = { unknown: '未验证', blocked: '需人工处理', healthy: '最近同步已验证', stale: '证据已过期', failed: '同步或状态读取异常' }; const reasons = { screen_permission: '缺少屏幕录制授权，无法获取登录二维码；聊天采集器尚未接通。', login_required: '需要登录，登录后仍须独立验证采集器。', collector_missing: '缺少已验证的采集器。', sync_unverified: '尚无独立的成功同步证据。', no_local_data: '没有可用的本地同步数据。', sync_error: '需检查对应连接器；原始错误不会暴露在此页。' }; const fmt = value => value ? new Date(value).toLocaleString('zh-CN', { timeZone: 'Asia/Shanghai', month: '2-digit', day: '2-digit', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hour12: false }) : '—'; %>
<main><h1>外部数据源</h1>
<div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead><tr><th>数据源</th><th>分类</th><th>接入阶段</th><th>同步状态</th><th>最近成功</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<% if (!it.sources.length) { %><tr><td colspan="6" class="dim">尚无数据源</td></tr><% } %>
<% it.categories.forEach(category => { %>
<% it.sources.filter(source => source.category === category.id).forEach(source => { %>
<tr data-source-id="<%= source.id %>">
<% const detailBody = capture(() => { %>
<p>方式：<%= source.method %></p><p><%= source.note %></p>
<% if (source.reason) { %><p><%= reasons[source.reason] %></p><% } %>
<p>状态证据时间：<%= fmt(source.checkedAt) %></p>
<p>已有索引 / 处理记录数：<%= source.recordCount === null ? '未确认' : source.recordCount %>（不是历史完整性证明）</p>
<p class="dim">超过 <%= source.staleHours %> 小时未更新证据时，不再显示为当前正常。</p>
<% }); %>
<td class="name"><%= source.name %></td>
<td class="dim"><%= category.name %></td>
<td><%= phases[source.phase] %></td>
<td class="state-<%= source.state %>"><%= states[source.state] %></td>
<td><%= fmt(source.lastSuccessAt) %></td>
<td class="controls"><%~ include("detail-dialog", { detailId: "source-" + source.id, detailTitle: source.name, detailBody }) %></td>
</tr><% }) %><% }) %>
</tbody></table></div>
<p class="note">上海时间 · 每个数据源一行 · 详情见右侧 · 更新于 <%= fmt(it.generatedAt) %> · <a href="/sources">刷新</a></p>
<% const helpBody = capture(() => { %>
<p>只读管理页，打开页面不会发起同步、登录或模型调用。安装 / 登录不等于采集成功。</p>
<p>未配置项只是接入目录，不表示已获得账户授权。同步计划在 Scheduled 查看；私人数据的聊天可见范围由检索权限另行控制。</p>
<p>页面不展示正文、身份、密钥或登录二维码。</p>
<% }); %>
<div class="note"><%~ include("detail-dialog", { detailId: "sources-help", detailTitle: "数据说明", detailLabel: "数据说明", detailBody: helpBody }) %></div>
</main><%~ include("detail-ui") %>
</body></html>
